:"師古曰：累重，謂妻子、資產也。累，力瑞翻。重，直用翻。余吾水在朔方北。山海經曰：北鮮之山，鮮水出焉，北流注于余吾。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：累重，谓妻子、资产也。累，力瑞翻。重，直用翻。余吾水在朔方北。山海经曰：北鲜之山，鲜水出焉，北流注于余吾。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"9055e38a-db0e-11ef-8aab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"廣利","people_name_jianti_auto":"广利","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"9055e393-db0e-11ef-9f34-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9055e394-db0e-11ef-af38-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：史記·匈奴傳云廣利於此降匈奴，誤。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：史记·匈奴传云广利于此降匈奴，误。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"9055e392-db0e-11ef-afc4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"貳師將軍","official_note":"貳師將軍是漢武帝時期設置的將軍名號，主要用於遠征西域，此處李廣利擔任此職，率軍出擊匈奴。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"遣貳師將軍李廣利將騎六萬、步兵七萬出朔方","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"458277a3-fd62-42ff-a0ad-e3c436b433cb"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"強弩都尉","official_note":"強弩都尉是漢代軍職，負責指揮弩兵部隊，此處路博德擔任此職，協助貳師將軍作戰。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"強弩都尉路博德將萬餘人與貳師會","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"0048d423-37f9-4a67-aaff-bfe4f8550358"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"游擊將軍","official_note":"游擊將軍是漢代將軍名號，負責機動作戰，此處韓說擔任此職，率軍從五原出擊匈奴。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"游擊將軍韓說將步兵三萬人出五原","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"c82a0cff-292f-4772-b980-a8669fad96c1"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"因杅將軍","official_note":"因杅將軍是漢武帝時期臨時設置的將軍名號，此處公孫敖擔任此職，率軍從鴈門出擊匈奴。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"因杅將軍公孫敖將騎萬、步兵三萬人出鴈門","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"89f45e11-53d9-403a-a829-0f3b83d3f310"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","of