为汉朝出使匈奴，后因李延年被灭族事件，逃亡至匈奴，受到匈奴单于的重用，封丁零王，经常参与匈奴的国家政治，对匈奴的政治产生了巨大影响。","link_td_id":"Q10013020","link_td_number_id":1545790,"people_name":"衞律","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞律","people_xingming":"卫律","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"90583883-db0e-11ef-9e91-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-135,"link_death_year":-79,"link_td_description":"卫律，生於长安，出身长水胡，曾为汉朝出使匈奴，后因李延年被灭族事件，逃亡至匈奴，受到匈奴单于的重用，封丁零王，经常参与匈奴的国家政治，对匈奴的政治产生了巨大影响。","link_td_id":"Q10013020","link_td_number_id":1545790,"people_name":"衞律","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞律","people_xingming":"卫律","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"90583884-db0e-11ef-8215-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-74,"link_td_description":"李陵，字少卿，陇西成纪人，西汉将领李广之孙，汉武帝期间曾以少击多攻打匈奴，但后来因政治事件考虑最终投降匈奴。","link_td_id":"Q10008004","link_td_number_id":6265,"people_name":"陵","people_name_jianti_auto":"陵","people_xingming":"李陵","start_index":132,"tongjian_id":"90583885-db0e-11ef-bcce-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9055e3b6-db0e-11ef-a30b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9055e3b7-db0e-11ef-92f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"9055e3b8-db0e-11ef-ae3f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"9055e3b9-db0e-11ef-95b8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交","人事"],"content":"時上遣敖深入匈奴迎李陵，敖軍無功還，因曰：「捕得生口，言李陵敎單于爲兵以備漢軍，故臣無所得。」上於是族陵家。旣而聞之，乃漢將降匈奴者李緒，非陵也。陵使人刺殺緒。大閼氏欲殺陵，單于匿之北方；大閼氏死，乃還。單于以女妻陵，立爲右校王，與衞律皆貴用事。衞律常在單于左右；陵居外，有大事乃入議。","content_fanyi":"当时，汉武帝派遣公孙敖率军深入匈奴境内迎接李陵，公孙敖的军队没有取得战功就返回了，于是上奏说：“据俘获的匈奴俘虏说，李陵把制造兵器的办法教给单于，用来防备汉军，因此臣下毫无收获。”汉武帝于是将李陵全家灭族。随后又听说，做这件事的是投降匈奴的汉朝将领李绪，并不是李陵。李陵派人刺杀了李绪。单于的母亲大阏氏想要杀掉李陵，单于便把李陵藏在北方；大阏氏死后，李陵才返回。单于把女儿嫁给李陵，封他为右校王，与卫律都位尊而掌权。卫律常在单于身边；李陵住在外面，遇有大事才入王庭议事。","content_jianti_auto":"时上遣敖深入匈奴迎李陵，敖军无功还，因曰：「捕得生口，言李陵教单于为兵以备汉军，故臣无所得。」上于是族陵家。既而闻之，乃汉将降匈奴者李绪，非陵也。陵使人刺杀绪。大阏氏欲杀陵，单于匿之北方；大阏氏死，乃还。单于以女妻陵，立为右校王，与衞律皆贵用事。衞律常在单于左右；陵居外，有大事乃入议。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，则嫁其祸于李绪；迨其后李广利征匈奴，陵将三万余骑追汉军...","context_before":"...援，则以步卒五千出塞，陵自炫其勇，而非武帝命之不获辞也。","source_end_index":75,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6f95e1a5-132c-4df5-ad1f-c1815274e05f","source_start_index":71,"source_text":"陵之族也"}],"title":"三〇 迁史为李陵文饰"}],"id":1783,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9055e3a7-db0e-11ef-bc59-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"昌邑國","place_name_jianti_auto":"昌邑国","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"90583888-db0e-11ef-b0b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"兗州","place_name_jianti_auto":"兖州","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"90583889-db0e-11ef-953f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"山陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"山阳郡","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9058388a-db0e-11ef-9c42-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"9058388b-db0e-11ef-89f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"9058388c-db0e-11ef-87ea-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"亳","place_name_jianti_auto":"亳","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"9058388d-db0e-11ef-b710-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"單","place_name_jianti_auto":"单","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9058388e-db0e-11ef-b1e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄆","place_name_jianti_auto":"郓","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"9058388f-db0e-11ef-812a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"髆，音博。昌邑國屬兗州，卽山陽郡地；其地在唐之宋、亳、單、鄆四州間。考異曰：表云六月乙丑立，今從武紀。","note_content_jianti_auto":"髆，音博。昌邑国属兖州，即山阳郡地；其地在唐之宋、亳、单、郓四州间。考异曰：表云六月乙丑立，今从武纪。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"90583887-db0e-11ef-bae8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-88,"link_td_description":"刘髆，西汉诸侯王，汉武帝第五子，李夫人所生。","link_td_id":"Q10010253","link_td_number_id":1006090,"people_name":"髆","people_name_jianti_auto":"髆","people_xingming":"刘髆","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"90583893-db0e-11ef-98aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-88,"link_td_description":"刘髆，西汉诸侯王，汉武帝第五子，李夫人所生。","link_td_id":"Q10010253","link_td_number_id":1006090,"people_name":"昌邑王","people_name_jianti_auto":"昌邑王","people_xingming":"刘髆","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"90583894-db0e-11ef-a320-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"90583886-db0e-11ef-a62b-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"bó","source_anchor_text":"月立皇子髆為昌邑王","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":9,"text":"髆","tongjian_id":"d85538a3-8dc3-5152-a210-5b9c1a215659"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3夏，四月，立皇子髆爲昌邑王。","content_fanyi":"夏季四月，汉武帝册立皇子刘髆为昌邑王。","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，四月，立皇子髆为昌邑王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1784,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"90583886-db0e-11ef-a62b-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"四年","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9055e37d-db0e-11ef-9d92-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（甲申、前九七）","year_int":-97},"message":"success","success":true}